er\"><div class=\"dfpAd ad-middle ad-text\"><div id=\"infobae/peru/nota/middle_1_300x250\" class=\"infobae/peru/nota/middle_1_300x250 arcad\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"feed-list-wrapper\"><div id=\"fusion-static-enter:title-feed-list\" style=\"display:none\" data-fusion-component=\"title-feed-list\"></div><h2 class=\"ht-h1 margint16\"><span class=\"orange\">Últimas Noticias</span></h2><div id=\"fusion-static-exit:title-feed-list\" style=\"display:none\" data-fusion-component=\"title-feed-list\"></div><div id=\"fusion-static-enter:SRX6VUEWQRDRTKEV7OFX7FL5HI-feed-list-story\" style=\"display:none\" data-fusion-component=\"SRX6VUEWQRDRTKEV7OFX7FL5HI-feed-list-story\"></div><a class=\"feed-list-card feed-list-card-first\" href=\"/peru/2025/07/24/carrera-5k-en-magdalena-del-mar-busca-promover-la-inclusion-de-personas-con-discapacidad/\"><div class=\"col1\"><h2 class=\"feed-list-card-headline-lean feed-list-card-headline-lean-first\">Carrera 5K en Magdalena del Mar busca promover la inclusión de personas con discapacidad</h2><h3 class=\"deck deck-first\">El Ministerio de Desarrollo e Inclusión Social celebra una década de trabajo a favor de quienes enfrentan barreras sociales mediante una jornada deportiva abierta a toda la comunidad con enfoque accesible e integrador</h3></div><div class=\"col2\"><div class=\"global-picture\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://www.infobae.com/resizer/v2/7A4TRAXC4JG2LKO5DNB6QCP64Y.jpeg?auth=ac29bb193c3741809a6bf6ac6af33620dba124d6945e02ad2003ff4bd0f6eb0b&amp;smart=true&amp;width=400&amp;height=225&amp;quality=85\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px)\"></source><source srcset=\"https://www.infobae.com/resizer/v2/7A4TRAXC4JG2LKO5DNB6QCP64Y.jpeg?auth=ac29bb193c3741809a6bf6ac6af33620dba124d6945e02ad2003ff4bd0f6eb0b&amp;smart=true&amp;width=420&amp;height=236&amp;quality=85\" media=\"(min-width: 350px)\"></source><source srcset=\"https://www.infobae.com/resizer/v2/7A4TRAXC4JG2LKO5DNB6QCP64Y.jpeg?auth=ac29bb193c3741809a6bf6ac6af33620dba